'''Hazard''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. Its blade is made up of a yellow and brown hazard stripe pattern and a jagged off-white edge, hence the name. The guard is brown, and the handle is solid black.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Hazard (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

